{"2566340": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gedonia 2", "steam_appid": 2566340, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4207070], "detailed_description": "<strong>Cooperative Multiplayer:</strong> Dive into the vast and immersive world of Gedonia with friends like never before! Introducing a cooperative multiplayer feature that supports up to 4 players, embark on a journey either solo or with a team. Whether you want to brave the challenges alone or share the experience with friends, the choice is yours. Every quest, every challenge, and every corner of the world is accessible and completable in both single-player and multiplayer modes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/704a007e8a4340269435660485a5de91.poster.avif?t=1771882458\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/704a007e8a4340269435660485a5de91.webm?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/704a007e8a4340269435660485a5de91.mp4?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Advanced Character Building:</strong> Discover a deepened and more intricate character building system, allowing players to craft and customize hundreds of unique builds. Experiment with different abilities, attributes, and playstyles to forge your own distinct hero or villain. Your character, your rules!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/ad7adfaacf26fad08c17bb0aa376b1e4.poster.avif?t=1771882458\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/ad7adfaacf26fad08c17bb0aa376b1e4.webm?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/ad7adfaacf26fad08c17bb0aa376b1e4.mp4?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A Truly Dynamic Open World:</strong> Gedonia's world isn't just vast; it's alive. Roam the expansive landscapes freely, unveiling hidden mysteries, confronting formidable enemies, deciphering puzzles, and unearthing treasured rewards. With a world as dynamic as Gedonia, every exploration becomes an unforgettable tale.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/0e8e7ba4ef6e2731faa8bd521605be08.poster.avif?t=1771882458\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/0e8e7ba4ef6e2731faa8bd521605be08.webm?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/0e8e7ba4ef6e2731faa8bd521605be08.mp4?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Consequential Actions:</strong> In Gedonia 2, every action echoes in the universe. Make choices that not only define your character's path but also mold and transform the world around you. Experience the ripple effects of your decisions, both immediate and long-term, as they lead to surprising and often drastic consequences.<br><br><strong>Enhanced Crafting System:</strong> Crafting takes a leap forward in Gedonia 2! With a more intuitive and expansive crafting interface, create powerful weapons, intricate armors, and useful items that can aid you in your adventures. The world offers raw materials in abundance; it's up to you to harness their potential.<br><br><strong>Engaging, Hand-Crafted Quests:</strong> Dive into meticulously designed quests, each carrying its own narrative weight, challenges, and decisions. Influence the outcomes of these quests through your choices, be it through strategic decision-making or skill-check dialogue options. Every path offers a unique story, and it's your choices that pen the narrative.<br><br>Join us in Gedonia 2, where adventure awaits at every turn, and where your story is yet to be written. Dive in, and let's write it together.", "about_the_game": "<strong>Cooperative Multiplayer:</strong> Dive into the vast and immersive world of Gedonia with friends like never before! Introducing a cooperative multiplayer feature that supports up to 4 players, embark on a journey either solo or with a team. Whether you want to brave the challenges alone or share the experience with friends, the choice is yours. Every quest, every challenge, and every corner of the world is accessible and completable in both single-player and multiplayer modes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/704a007e8a4340269435660485a5de91.poster.avif?t=1771882458\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/704a007e8a4340269435660485a5de91.webm?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/704a007e8a4340269435660485a5de91.mp4?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Advanced Character Building:</strong> Discover a deepened and more intricate character building system, allowing players to craft and customize hundreds of unique builds. Experiment with different abilities, attributes, and playstyles to forge your own distinct hero or villain. Your character, your rules!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/ad7adfaacf26fad08c17bb0aa376b1e4.poster.avif?t=1771882458\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/ad7adfaacf26fad08c17bb0aa376b1e4.webm?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/ad7adfaacf26fad08c17bb0aa376b1e4.mp4?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A Truly Dynamic Open World:</strong> Gedonia's world isn't just vast; it's alive. Roam the expansive landscapes freely, unveiling hidden mysteries, confronting formidable enemies, deciphering puzzles, and unearthing treasured rewards. With a world as dynamic as Gedonia, every exploration becomes an unforgettable tale.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/0e8e7ba4ef6e2731faa8bd521605be08.poster.avif?t=1771882458\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/0e8e7ba4ef6e2731faa8bd521605be08.webm?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/extras/0e8e7ba4ef6e2731faa8bd521605be08.mp4?t=1771882458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Consequential Actions:</strong> In Gedonia 2, every action echoes in the universe. Make choices that not only define your character's path but also mold and transform the world around you. Experience the ripple effects of your decisions, both immediate and long-term, as they lead to surprising and often drastic consequences.<br><br><strong>Enhanced Crafting System:</strong> Crafting takes a leap forward in Gedonia 2! With a more intuitive and expansive crafting interface, create powerful weapons, intricate armors, and useful items that can aid you in your adventures. The world offers raw materials in abundance; it's up to you to harness their potential.<br><br><strong>Engaging, Hand-Crafted Quests:</strong> Dive into meticulously designed quests, each carrying its own narrative weight, challenges, and decisions. Influence the outcomes of these quests through your choices, be it through strategic decision-making or skill-check dialogue options. Every path offers a unique story, and it's your choices that pen the narrative.<br><br>Join us in Gedonia 2, where adventure awaits at every turn, and where your story is yet to be written. Dive in, and let's write it together.", "short_description": "Gedonia 2 is an online coop RPG, which allows up to 4 players to freely explore living open world and build absolutely unique characters. An expanded and improved sequel for RPG Gedonia.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/header.jpg?t=1771882458", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771882458", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566340/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771882458", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win10 64-bits Version 21H2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6700 or AMD Ryzen5 1500X or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX960 4GB or AMD 380X 4GB or Higher<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 18 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas